WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.420
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.900
Yusaku...

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.390
I leave the rest to you.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:17.600
Playmaker, how does it feel 
to defeat your friend?

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.180
You couldn't save your dearest friend.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:30.240
He vanished, disappointed that you 
couldn't protect a simple promise.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.950
Kusanagi doesn't hate me.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.940
He was proud of me!

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.680
You're the ones who lost!

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.330
Playmaker!

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.070
Playmaker!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.740
Soulburner!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.980
Lightning!  Bohman!

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:09.710
You stomped on someone you 
absolutely shouldn't have!

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:15.230
I'll never forgive you!

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:38.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:45.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:52.400
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:58.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:05.720
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:12.950
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:19.660
I want to share your pain

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:52.420
Hey!  What's wrong, Playmaker?

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:54.920
Wake up!  C'mon!

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.170
What's going on?

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:59.680
He won, but it's like he lost.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.260
It's over for us!

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:05.130
You fool!  Don't whine so quickly!

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.830
Playmaker!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.830
You're the hope for humanity!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.380
Stand up, Playmaker!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.200
That's right.  Stand up, Playmaker.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.820
Humanity's hope can't be this pathetic.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.550
Stand up and fight me.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:26.060
You say that knowing he can't!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.420
There's no fair or foul in dueling.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.950
Defeat those who can be 
defeated by any means.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.160
That's logic.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.830
Wake up, Playmaker!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.480
Stop it!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.900
Keep your hands off Playmaker!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.140
I'll take you on!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:49.490
Ignis, you shouldn't be so arrogant.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.310
We've hacked into Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.690
Remove the barrier and contact Revolver.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.660
Wake up and fight me.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.850
You must be kidding!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.130
You can see he's in no condition to duel!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:16.100
That's enough, Lightning.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.930
We'll soon supplant humans.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:31.280
By defeating Playmaker fair and square, 
it'll prove that we should rule over humans.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:37.490
If you defeat a wounded lion by cheating, 
all you're doing is giving them an excuse.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.960
So it can't be by any means, Lightning.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.330
Understood.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.200
The barrier is destroyed!

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.420
Are you okay, Revolver?

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.070
Yes.  Well done.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:05:00.080
Transfer this data to the 
Light Ignis immediately.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.220
Understood.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:05.880
And I have one more request.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.620
The Data Storm has started blowing.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:12.320
Someone destroyed the 
barrier from the outside.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.290
Who did it?  Kusanagi is gone.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.170
Let's go, Lightning.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.170
We can't let the final two make their move.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.400
Understood.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.420
Let's go.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.800
This is a message from Revolver.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.780
They left, Boss!

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.200
What should we do?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:48.560
We can't just abandon Playmaker.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.120
You're right.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.410
But I'm also concerned about Bohman.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.000
Which should we choose?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.820
The barrier is gone!

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:02.770
Those punks!  I'll defeat them!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.850
I'll beat them!  They won't go unpunished!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.060
Come out, Lightning!  Bohman!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.510
Fight me!

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:43.550
I don't care which one!  Show yourself!

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:48.020
I'll be your opponent, Soulburner.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.990
Bohman...  Fine!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.960
I'll defeat you first!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:56.350
I'm looking forward to it.  Follow me.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:26.790
What?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.640
This is the battlefield?

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:48.380
I now have the power of water, 
so I've readied a suitable field.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:52.940
Everything you do is cruel!

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.250
Calm down, Soulburner.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:02.810
Look!  It's Bohman vs Soulburner this time!

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:06.140
There's so much tension!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.760
Film them!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.900
This'll be an unbelievable duel!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.910
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:22.310
Playmaker was my hero!

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:27.040
After the Lost Incident, 
my grandparents took me in.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.330
I didn't care if I lived or not.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.190
I was a thug who didn't go to school.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:37.430
I just lived in the moment.  
With no hope for the future.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.100
But one day, I learned about Playmaker.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.940
I changed that day.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:49.240
Because of Playmaker, I'm now who I am!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:56.250
I now know you and I are 
completely different!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:01.620
You get rid of people whose 
ideas differ than yours!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.860
And you do it logically.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:10.760
You and Flame work together as 
friends, but you disapprove of AIs?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.330
I didn't say that!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.330
This isn't about humans or AIs!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:19.340
You did what you shouldn't have!

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:23.580
Something that can't be forgiven, 
no matter what you are!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.310
I'm emotionally touched right now.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.780
What?

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:37.450
I'm touched that you're angry at me.  
Because that acknowledges I have a personality.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:41.790
Only you and Playmaker 
have treated me this way.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.230
Only you two.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.200
Stop messing around!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:50.210
I respectfully challenge you to a duel.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.530
It's time to settle things.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:58.180
To prepare for my fight against Playmaker, 
I'll use this duel as my final test.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:02.080
Fine.  As you wish, I'll 
make this your final one!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.150
By defeating you!

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.180
Duel!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.140
It started!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.090
I'll broadcast it!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.690
Soulburner vs Bohman.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:20.630
His Hydradrive Deck counters 
various Attributes.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.880
Blue Maiden and Aqua lost against it.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.370
Stay focused.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:29.620
I know this matchup is horrible for me.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.340
But I must defeat him!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.310
I'll go first.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:39.930
I Special Summon Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.860
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.960
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.400
Link Summon.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:54.870
Link 1 Burn Hydradrive!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:11:01.610
When there's a Fire monster on your field, 
Burn Hydradrive can attack you directly.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:05.340
So you already know my Attribute.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:09.450
Next, I summon Hydradrive Bringer!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:16.860
When it's summoned, I add a Hydradrive 
from my graveyard to my hand.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:21.260
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.400
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.220
Link Summon.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:29.140
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:36.410
Since the Link Marker is pointed at the 
Spell & Trap Zone, I activate a Link Spell.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.400
The three arrows that judge the world!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:42.380
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.110
Judgment Arrows.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.090
He already played it.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:52.060
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.190
The summoning conditions are 
two Hydradrive Link Monsters!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.060
I set Burn and Coolant in the Link Markers.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.580
Link Summon.

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:09.570
Appear, Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:15.640
When Twin Hydradrive Knight 
is Link Summoned...

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:19.680
...its Attributes become the same as 
the two Hydradrives used to summon it.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:23.180
It becomes Fire and Water Attribute.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.760
I activate the Continuous Spell, 
Hydradrive Protection...

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:34.170
...on a Hydradrive Link Monster on my 
field and a card in my Spell & Trap Zone!

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.170
As long as it's in the Spell & Trap Zone...

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:44.410
...your effects can't affect Twin 
Hydradrive Knight and Judgment Arrows!

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:49.720
His Hydradrive Deck deals with Attributes.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:52.380
I know how it works, but 
it's a problematic strategy.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.220
I end my turn.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:58.220
Soulburner, don't go all out.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.320
Or you'll trip up.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.160
I know!

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.840
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:09.170
I activate the Field Spell, 
Salamangreat Shrine!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.960
When I summon a Salamangreat Link Monster...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:16.640
...I can Link Summon using 
another copy on my field!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:21.110
It's a new Field Spell to help 
you Reincarnation Link Summon.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.120
Next, I summon Jack Jaguar!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.650
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:33.990
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4 or lower Cyberse!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.640
Link Summon!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:39.700
Appear, Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:46.270
When it's Link Summoned, I add Salamangreat 
Sanctuary in my deck to my hand!

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:47.770
No you won't!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:57.220
Your monsters with the same Attribute as 
Twin Hydradrive Knight have their effects negated.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.950
Property Zero!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.880
The Field Spell, Salamangreat 
Shrine's effect!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:10.330
Your Fire monsters' effects 
can't affect our Salamangreats!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:19.180
I see.  You've prepared 
countermeasures against me.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.340
You're acting pretty confident!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:27.120
On the turn that I Link Summoned, I can 
Special Summon Mole due to its own effect!

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.450
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.050
Link Summon!

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:40.160
Appear, Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.800
Jack Jaguar's effect from my graveyard!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.000
When there's a Salamangreat 
Link Monster on the field...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.520
...I return a non-Jack Jaguar Salamangreat 
in my graveyard to my deck!

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:59.010
Then I Special Summon Jack Jaguar 
next to Sunlight Wolf's link!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:02.510
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:06.710
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4 or lower Cyberse!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.190
Link Summon!

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:11.850
Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.460
Sunlight Wolf's effect!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:19.170
When a monster is Special 
Summoned next to its link...

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.410
...I return a Salamangreat 
in my graveyard to my hand!

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.540
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:30.740
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:32.480
Link Summon!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:37.940
Appear!  Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.340
But he has Judgment Arrows.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.340
We have to do something about that.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:49.620
I want to use Heatleo's effect 
to return Judgment Arrows.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:52.900
But due to Hydradrive 
Protection's effect, I can't.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.870
So first...

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.100
Resounding Roar!

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:00.070
Hydradrive Protection returns to your deck!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.850
I see.  So that's what you were aiming for!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.200
Not bad!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:15.720
Due to Salamangreat Shrine's effect, 
I Reincarnation Link Summon Heatleo!

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:22.330
Surging flame, awaken Heatleo's true 
strength with the power of purification!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.000
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.160
Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:33.530
When it's Link Summoned, one card in your 
Spell & Trap Zone is returned to your deck!

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:35.820
Good!  It'll work this time!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.600
I return Judgment Arrows!

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:50.410
When Judgment Arrows leaves the field, its 
effect destroys all monsters next to its links!

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:52.960
All right!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.770
Don't get impatient.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:58.200
Hydradrive Protection's effect still works.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.660
What?

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.620
On the turn Hydradrive 
Protection leaves the field...

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:12.880
...effects can't destroy 
Twin Hydradrive Knight.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.350
But I still have other moves!

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.520
The Reincarnation Link Summoned 
Heatleo's effect activates!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:25.060
The ATK of a monster on the field become 
the same as a monster in the graveyard!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:31.030
Twin Hydradrive Knight's ATK become 
the same as Salamangreat Mole's!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.100
0?

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:39.320
Soulburner is fighting hard!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.320
Look, Play-

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.740
Here I go, Bohman!  Battle!

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:51.580
Salamangreat Heatleo attacks 
Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.570
This is for Kusanagi and Playmaker!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.690
Take this!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.200
I end my turn!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.920
It worked!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.560
This fight is too hot!

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:16.210
Because Heatleo is on fire!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.180
That's not what I meant!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.180
Impressive, Soulburner.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:24.300
Your duel shines.  You should be proud.

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.420
You're worthy of praise.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.120
You're still acting confident?

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.890
Don't let him provoke you, Soulburner!

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.860
My anger hasn't subsided yet!

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:42.000
With the fire of anger, 
I'll burn you to a crisp!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:47.500
I'll respond to your shine 
by using all my power!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.740
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:54.200
When we both don't have monsters 
in our Main Monster Zones...

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:58.750
...I can Special Summon Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.370
I tribute Hydradrive Booster.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.730
I Tribute Summon Hydradrive 
Agent from my hand.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:15.700
When it's Tribute Summoned, I can Special 
Summon a Hydradrive from my graveyard!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:19.600
Resurrect, Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:28.550
If I summon a Link Monster with 
this effect, I draw one card.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:32.280
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.440
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Hydradrives,

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.460
which includes a Level 5 
or higher Effect Monster!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.420
Link Summon!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:47.930
Link 3 Paradox Hydradrive Atlas!

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.780
It's the monster from before!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.740
That's the one!

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.240
What's wrong, Flame?

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.610
I'm fine.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:16.100
So he's the one who destroyed Cyberse World!

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:21.070
I still feel anger and 
sadness from that time.

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:25.380
This duel is a fight to mourn 
the loss of my homeworld!

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.140
That's my will!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:31.570
Will...  That's a very troublesome thing.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:35.400
If there was no will, we 
AI wouldn't have evolved.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:42.190
But if the will is too strong and magnifies, 
we'll walk the same foolish path as humans.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:46.420
But I can maintain that balance!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.480
Flame, don't fear defeat.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.320
Don't feel ashamed.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.630
I accept you.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:59.480
This is the perfect time to tell you this:

